                Weekend Offer: Up to 60% OFF on selected products
                <span class="flash-text">FLASH SALE</span>
                &nbsp;&bull;&nbsp;
                Use code <strong>MPremium</strong> for extra savings
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="top-strip-right">
            <nav class="top-quick-menu" aria-label="Quick links">
